SOURCE-AVAILABLE, NOT OPEN SOURCE

The source code of Inkwyrd Audio is published so that anyone can read it,
see exactly what the program does, and satisfy themselves that it is safe
to run - which matters more than usual here, because the downloads are not
code-signed and Windows will warn about them.

Publishing the source does not place it in the public domain, and does not
grant permission to reuse it. The terms below are what you are given.


